[{"title":"邓宁极过访索赠丛竹园诗","author":"何吾驺","text":"五柳先生丛竹园，烟封此日几开门。\n当年饱食横眠处，千亩犹堪捧腹论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己卯八月十五夜大风雨赋示诸生并儿侄三首 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"梧露槐霜漱桂枝，广寒如洗澹妆眉。\n雷声也似儿声细，都谓蛟龙得雨时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己卯八月十五夜大风雨赋示诸生并儿侄三首 其二","author":"何吾驺","text":"万国同风十二年，冯夷吹向日南天。\n当场定有翻空手，出为吾君洗毒烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己卯八月十五夜大风雨赋示诸生并儿侄三首 其三","author":"何吾驺","text":"文光百尺拥登坛，电影交旂照画栏。\n愿得司衡心似月，天河一浣转芒寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨三首 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"经年结构荫高槐，一雨清斋化劫灰。\n欲向鸣蛙留半部，满床诗草送风雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨三首 其二","author":"何吾驺","text":"滮滮屋底走黄河，乍似鱼龙戏海过。\n谁谓凿坯堪遁去，惊回四壁已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨三首 其三","author":"何吾驺","text":"阴精离毕已多时，玉女投壶恐未知。\n数尺兴波遑问路，何人霄汉漫裁诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄亦非上人","author":"何吾驺","text":"能祖南归道便南，亦非一指与谁参。\n等閒祸水三千劫，都扣真人火一龛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李伯苓","author":"何吾驺","text":"坐破蒲团慧自生，雪窗何处问袁宏。\n欲寻花雨东风面，别有新篇佐渭城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史五首 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"西汉文章尽剧秦，世风到此又安论。\n中兴满绘功臣像，谁为严陵写钓纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史五首 其二","author":"何吾驺","text":"委质为臣不二心，当年庞德节千寻。\n叩头于禁今安在，芳臭从前话到今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史五首 其三","author":"何吾驺","text":"夜静春林怨杜鹃，声声啼入介山烟。\n不知望帝归何日，肠断相从十九年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史五首 其四","author":"何吾驺","text":"乍支霜月照琵琶，拨断冰弦起暮笳。\n一百离宫无此曲，梦魂飞奏碧窗纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史五首 其五","author":"何吾驺","text":"一帘秋色送荆门，暮雨翻销郢客魂。\n旧国岧峣名下士，阳春白雪许谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫句","author":"何吾驺","text":"野草寒螀伴客眠，愁心何处对江天。\n芦沙一碧闻孤雁，欲写閒情不记年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"时于丁亥冬杪百物衰残读昔人七哀不禁呜咽辄赋所感因物自伤不在乎数也感萤","author":"何吾驺","text":"短篱腐草化流萤，闪闪光飞似自矜。\n不是向明心一点，夕阳何处问渔灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感鹊","author":"何吾驺","text":"飞飞精卫志填河，衔石何如炼石多。\n不恨茫茫沧海阔，所嗟门外有风波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感鹤","author":"何吾驺","text":"一往穿云入汉游，长风吹断送沧洲。\n谁传华表千年恨，鳷鹊无情不共愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感燕","author":"何吾驺","text":"画栋雕梁旧送迎，乌衣巷口与谁争。\n寻常百性新王谢，紫燕何知是世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感雁","author":"何吾驺","text":"万里衡阳未复归，嗷嗷岂为稻粱肥。\n帛书曾否传苏武，塞外于今使节稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感鹃","author":"何吾驺","text":"遗事何因化杜鹃，春风到此也相煎。\n千林寒鸟都啼晓，独自三更染血烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感蚓","author":"何吾驺","text":"上饮黄泉下土壤，夜来唧唧尽愁肠。\n屈伸尺蠖求何事，岂有孤情到首阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感灯草","author":"何吾驺","text":"十尺心为一寸心，荧荧永夜出重阴。\n兰膏剔尽还留性，取放虚灵照古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成二首 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"世间极乐唯无事，高坐焚香日几时。\n阶下无人喧鸟集，前身或恐是黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成二首 其二","author":"何吾驺","text":"世间极乐唯无事，淡饭粗羹野葛衣。\n不学后生讲清课，北窗高枕是和非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛指柑为劳仁伯赋","author":"何吾驺","text":"膜拜当年未有图，莲花座下顶跏趺。\n知君五体俱投地，好倩香柑佛指扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李豫石常吉得旨归养赋赠 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"石磴悬崖苦竹根，春风为爱长儿孙。\n琅玕百尺淩空上，归赋南山尽主恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李豫石常吉得旨归养赋赠 其二","author":"何吾驺","text":"旂常屈指古名臣，母在难酬报国身。\n从此邱樊酣住世，知君何意借垂纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李豫石常吉得旨归养赋赠 其三","author":"何吾驺","text":"一经万里著金门，归拥朱衣尚泪痕。\n愿祝千龄衔舜日，徵书将母起輶轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李豫石常吉得旨归养赋赠 其四","author":"何吾驺","text":"前贤谱里定盘针，我母觞馀更问心。\n但念慈乌须返哺，不知八表已为霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"欢爱莲花紫艳妆，侬爱莲花白雪光。\n一夜东风吹雨急，虽同落地各衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其二","author":"何吾驺","text":"朝来东望火云生，一霎回头送雨声。\n乍暖乍寒无住著，十二时中总世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其三","author":"何吾驺","text":"东家女儿食兼珍，西壁含饴但素羹。\n待各长成十五六，食贫嫁得好良人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31987,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其四","author":"何吾驺","text":"贵人高纛引褰帏，团扇交摇污满衣。\n只见长松箕踞者，也无是处也无非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31988,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其五","author":"何吾驺","text":"四月秧青五月齐，稻花初雨照前堤。\n大家载酒商农务，莫遣西风到夏畦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31989,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其六","author":"何吾驺","text":"稚子门前唱竹枝，花下佳人送和词。\n祇是闻声听不得，依稀犹似怨将离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31990,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊寅七夕同诸子酌松风阁分赋六首是月霖雨经旬 其一 得秋字","author":"何吾驺","text":"天上多情似女牛，一年一度锁新愁。\n今年甚雨同寒食，乌鹊桥边倍报秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31991,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979